<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English league and cup</p>
<p>soccer matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>F.A. Cup third round</p>
<p> Watford		   v  Oxford		    late kickoff</p>
<p>(Eventual winners away to Brentford or Manchester City</p>
<p>in the fourth round)</p>
<p> Luton		     1  Bolton		    1</p>
<p>(Eventual winners at home to Chesterfield)</p>
<p> Gillingham		0  Derby		     2</p>
<p>(Derby home to Notts County or Aston Villa)</p>
<p>Third round replay</p>
<p> Wimbledon		 2  Crewe		     0</p>
<p>(Wimbledon away to Manchester United)</p>
<p>League Cup quarter-final</p>
<p> Ipswich		   0  Leicester		 1</p>
<p>(Leicester meet Wimbledon in two-leg semifinals)</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Brentford		 0  Bristol Rovers	  0</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Cambridge		 3  Exeter		    2</p>
<p> Leyton Orient	   1  Wigan		     2</p>
<p> Mansfield		 2  Doncaster		 0</p>
</text>
